{"record_id": "RMUC2026:6.7:p131:p001", "record_type": "block", "sample": "multi_section_page", "doc_id": "RMUC2026", "version": "V2.2.0", "source_file": "2026 机甲大师超级对抗赛比赛规则手册V2.2.0.pdf", "sha256": "88AE3C7D0BBD7312C8095EFF2603910437E292A0B53F46C9378F26144C09A6F5", "section": {"section_id": 102, "section_no": "6.7", "title": "6.7 比赛结束", "name": "比赛结束", "level": 2, "path": ["6 比赛流程", "6.7 比赛结束"]}, "physical_page": 131, "printed_page": 130, "physical_pages": [131], "bbox": [56.64, 560.37, 538.81, 610.25], "block_kind": "paragraph", "raw_text": "当一局比赛时间耗尽或一方队伍提前触发获胜条件时，一局比赛结束。获胜条件参阅“5.8 赛制及获胜条\n件”。当场比赛决出胜负或结束所有局次后，一场比赛结束。 ", "norm_text": "当一局比赛时间耗尽或一方队伍提前触发获胜条件时，一局比赛结束。获胜条件参阅“5.8 赛制及获胜条件”。当场比赛决出胜负或结束所有局次后，一场比赛结束。", "source_lines": [{"page": 131, "bbox": [56.64, 560.37, 538.81, 590.57], "text": "当一局比赛时间耗尽或一方队伍提前触发获胜条件时，一局比赛结束。获胜条件参阅“5.8 赛制及获胜条"}, {"page": 131, "bbox": [56.64, 580.05, 337.69, 610.25], "text": "件”。当场比赛决出胜负或结束所有局次后，一场比赛结束。 "}], "line_count": 2, "cross_page": false, "normalization": {"rules": ["join_visual_linebreaks", "map_pua_bullets", "collapse_whitespace"], "chars_preserved": true}, "extraction": {"engine": "PyMuPDF 1.28.2 get_text('dict')", "fonts": ["SourceHanSerifSC-Light"], "max_font_size": 10.56, "assembled_from": "visual lines merged by geometry"}, "flags": {"is_heading": false, "is_list_item": false, "is_caption": false, "inside_table": false, "uses_cambria_math": false, "script_span_count": 0, "starts_with_figure_marker": false, "contains_formula": false, "contains_digit": true, "contains_greek": false, "contains_compare": false, "contains_unit": false}}
